### ============================================================
### Day3-3 動作確認用：迷子ペット登録 → 発見ペット登録 → マッチング実行
### ============================================================

### ① owner権限でログイン
# @name ownerLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/test-login?role=owner

###

### ② 迷子ペットの写真をアップロード
# @name lostPhotoUpload
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/photos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoib3duZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODgxNzgwMDJ9.QFS1fOTdeqZxXkf78ZnVz3iFJ1gnJb9JjLDjVUEhRd0
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-assets/test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### ③ 迷子ペット本体を登録（/pets/lost）
# ★修正：photoUrl(単数) → photoUrls(配列)に変更。モデル側がList<String>を要求するようになったため、
# 1枚しかなくても配列 [ ] で囲んで送る必要がある
# @name lostPetRegister
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/lost
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoib3duZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODgxNzgwMDJ9.QFS1fOTdeqZxXkf78ZnVz3iFJ1gnJb9JjLDjVUEhRd0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photoUrls": ["https://cdjilctcmrzyijttaqnu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/pet-photos/3bde7e17-feaf-430e-96eb-3be94b146cc3_test.jpg"],
  "phoneNumber": "090-1234-5678",
  "specie": "柴犬",
  "color": "茶色",
  "other": "赤い首輪をしていた",
  "lostPlace": "石川県 輪島市 ○○町"
}

###

### ④ finder権限でログイン
# @name finderLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/test-login?role=finder

###

### ⑤ 発見ペットの写真をアップロード
# @name foundPhotoUpload
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/photos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyZWxpbmstYXBpIiwiYXVkIjoicmVsaW5rLXVzZXJzIiwidXNlcklkIjoidGVzdC11c2VyLTEiLCJyb2xlIjoiZmluZGVyIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg4MTc4MDUwfQ.UCXoDCgi-Eeb5xseAPFcUBgidbBK53FA83msHPcqBd4
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-assets/test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

